# Prism catalogue
This is a fictional lantern-display puzzle, not equipment guidance.

## Prism-Gates
Scope: Prism-Gates
Aliases: rainbow doors; split lights
Do not open Prism-Gates when the violet card is face down.
If the card is face up, opening is allowed except during the hush.

## Hush footnote
The hush forbids opening even with a face-up card; it qualifies the opening rule.
Higher steadiness means lower flicker likelihood, never higher.
The card is described as face up and as unreadable; its state remains disputed.

## Copper Wheels
Equipment: Copper Wheels
Roll Copper Wheels only on the striped mat.
Roll Copper Wheels only on the striped mat.
